flowchart TD
    U[Request / user edits] --> P[Planner draft Blueprint + Plan]
    P --> S[Schema + traceability validation]
    S --> PF[Provider feasibility]
    PF --> TF[Tester testability/design]
    TF --> CF[Coder feasibility]
    CF --> R{Findings require revision?}
    R -- Yes --> P
    R -- No --> A[Approval-ready Engineering Change Package]
    A --> H{Human approves?}
    H -- Modify / request change --> U
    H -- Approve --> I[Implementation]
    I --> X{Planner replan required?}
    X -- No --> V[Verification]
    X -- Yes --> P2[Planner package revision]
    P2 --> S
